buf.yaml . -> pb.yaml module: example.com/acme/v1-single-managed
buf.yaml.name buf.build/acme/core -> module: example.com/acme/v1-single-managed (a BSR name is no place pb fetches from)
buf.yaml deps[0] buf.build/googleapis/googleapis -> github.com/googleapis/googleapis@v1.0.0 (the dependency table)
the lint file's rulesets github.com/greatliontech/buf-rules -> github.com/greatliontech/buf-rules@v1.0.0 (discovered; the ruleset, declared by every module)
buf.lock deps[0] buf.build/googleapis/googleapis 00000000000000000000000000000002 !! a BSR commit names no git commit; pb's pin is the lockfile's own, made by the tidy
buf.yaml.lint.use DEFAULT -> enable: github.com/greatliontech/buf-rules:STANDARD (buf's DEFAULT is STANDARD)
buf.yaml.lint.allow_comment_ignores true -> the module's suppression comments are rewritten to pb:ignore
buf.yaml.breaking.use FILE -> enable: github.com/greatliontech/buf-rules:FILE
buf.gen.yaml plugins[0].local protoc-gen-go -> local: protoc-gen-go
buf.gen.yaml plugins[0].out gen/go -> out: gen/go
buf.gen.yaml plugins[0].opt paths=source_relative -> opt: paths=source_relative
buf.gen.yaml plugins[1].remote buf.build/protocolbuffers/go:v1.35.2 -> ref: ghcr.io/greatliontech/pb-plugins/protocolbuffers/go:v1.35.2 (the catalog)
buf.gen.yaml plugins[1].out gen/remote -> out: gen/remote
buf.gen.yaml managed.go_package_prefix.default example.com/acme/core/gen/go -> overrides: files ** option go_package prefix example.com/acme/core/gen/go
buf.gen.yaml managed.go_package_prefix.except buf.build/googleapis/googleapis !! names a module, which a module-relative glob cannot
buf.gen.yaml managed.go_package_prefix.override buf.build/acme/core=example.com/acme/core/gen/go/core !! names a module, which a module-relative glob cannot
buf.gen.yaml managed.optimize_for.default SPEED -> overrides: files ** option optimize_for value SPEED
buf.gen.yaml managed.override[0] file_option=java_multiple_files -> overrides: files ** option java_multiple_files value true
buf.gen.yaml managed.enabled true !! buf's defaults, a value computed per file for every option no rule of the file names: pb declares values alone
pb.yaml -> written
pb.lint.yaml -> written
pb.gen.yaml -> written
